{"slug":"feud-3nj8hx","title":"Feud","titleEn":"Feud","type":"series","year":0,"rating":0,"duration":45,"description":"Feud is an American anthology drama television series created by Ryan Murphy, Jaffe Cohen, and Michael Zam, which premiered on FX on March 5, 2017. Conceived as an anthology series, Feud's first season, Bette and Joan, chronicles the well-documented rivalry between Hollywood actresses Joan Crawford and Bette Davis during and after the production of their psychological horror thriller film What Ever Happened to Baby Jane? (1962); while the second season, Capote vs. The Swans, aired in 2024 and focuses on the fallout of a roman à clef story written by author Truman Capote based on the lives of a group of several New York socialites whom he termed \"the Swans\".","genres":["درام"],"poster":"/covers/tt1984119/poster.jpg","backdrop":"/covers/tt1984119/backdrop.jpg","posterUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt1984119/img","backdropUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt1984119/img","videoUrl":"","trailerUrl":null,"director":"","cast":[],"country":"نامشخص","ageRating":"+13","quality":"HD","sources":[],"featured":false,"trendingScore":0,"views":0,"source":"f2m","addedAt":"2026-09-13T23:26:39.863Z","episodes":[{"season":1,"number":1,"name":"قسمت 1","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Series/Feud/Feud.E01.1080p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","sources":[{"q":"1080p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","url":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Series/Feud/Feud.E01.1080p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","mb":687},{"q":"480p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","url":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Series/Feud/Feud.E01.480p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","mb":177},{"q":"720p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","url":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Series/Feud/Feud.E01.720p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","mb":320},{"q":"1080p","v":"دوبله فارسی","url":"https://bvxbbajd